      "octaneResult": "@octanejs/tanstack-table omits ./legacy from package exports and does not port useLegacyTable.",
      "rationale": "The legacy adapter exists only to migrate existing React v8 table apps; an Octane binding has no such migration surface and targets the v9 useTable API directly.",
