      "consumerImpact": "Imports of @octanejs/tanstack-table/legacy fail; consumers must use the v9 useTable surface.",
      "migrationGuidance": "Replace any ./legacy or useLegacyTable usage with useTable and the shared @tanstack/table-core feature APIs.",
